<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - Geo started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Geo started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment initiated coverage of Mexican builder Corporacion Geo with a buy rating.</p>
<p>Santader said in a statement it expects the company's earnings per share to jump to 1.50, 2.35, and 3.55 pesos for 1996, 1997, and 1998, respectively. In 1995, the company reported earnings per share of 0.95 pesos.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
